The `Container` component manages the state of the cards and renders them. It also defines the `moveCard` function, which is called when a card is dropped onto another card. The function updates the order of the cards based on the drag and drop indexes.

The `App` component wraps the `Container` component with the `DndProvider` from the React DnD library, which provides the necessary context for drag and drop functionality.

When a card is being dragged, its opacity is set to 0 to create a visual effect of the card being lifted. The `hover` method in the `useDrop` hook is used to determine the new index of the card when it is dropped onto another card.

